cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper."
title: "Padding to k: code and data"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/AbhishekBarali/padding-to-k"
abstract: >-
  Code, data and results for a preregistered study of what open-weight language models do when a
  JSON schema asks for a list of at least k entries but the document holds fewer than k items: eight
  open-weight models on 558 real documents from nine annotated datasets, and six more models on
  hosted services.
